# Allowlist, not a denylist (as in relational-fluency): code-only image;
# secrets, data and dev artefacts cannot get in by accident. Keep this list and
# the Dockerfile's COPY lines the same; tests/test_docker.py asserts it.
*

!requirements.txt
!server
!static

# Re-excluded from inside the paths above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.env
**/.env.*
